{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":185,"count":30,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L01-3-09\",\"谢谢\",\"謝謝\",\"谢谢\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A：謝謝你。 B：不客氣。","pinyin":"A: Xièxie nǐ. B: Bú kèqi.","english":"A: Thank you. B: You are welcome.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-3-10","sourceFront":"不客氣","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"老師：你們有問題嗎？ 學生：沒有。謝謝老師。","pinyin":"Lǎoshī: Nǐmen yǒu wèntí ma? Xuéshēng: Méi yǒu. Xièxie lǎoshī.","english":"Teacher: Do you have any questions? Student: No. Thank you, teacher.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-11","sourceFront":"問題","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們應該常常說請、謝謝。","pinyin":"Wǒmen yīnggāi chángcháng shuō qǐng, xièxie.","english":"We should say ‘please’, ‘thank you’ often.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-12","sourceFront":"應該","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"謝謝！明天晚上六點來我家，好不好？","pinyin":"Xièxie! Míngtiān wǎnshang liù diǎn lái wǒ jiā, hǎo bù hǎo?","english":"Thanks! How about coming to my place at 6 p.m. tomorrow?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"找您七百八十五塊錢，謝謝。","pinyin":"Zhǎo nín qī bǎi bāshíwǔ kuài qián, xièxie.","english":"Here is your 785 dollars of change, thanks.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"謝謝，這是我去年的生日禮物。","pinyin":"Xièxie, zhè shì wǒ qùnián de shēngrì lǐwù.","english":"Thanks, this is my birthday gift from last year.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"好，謝謝醫生。","pinyin":"Hǎo, xièxie yīshēng.","english":"Okay, Thank you doctor.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L02-2-12\",\"沒問題\",\"沒問題\",\"没问题\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"沒問題。","pinyin":"Méi wèntí.","english":"No problem.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我想走路去一定沒問題。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng zǒulù qù yídìng méi wèntí.","english":"I think it will certainly be okay going there on foot.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-01","sourceFront":"路/馬路","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"沒(not) + 問(ask) + 題(question) → no question, so no problem."},{"key":"[\"B1L04-2-19\",\"万\",\"萬\",\"万\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這些東西一共兩萬三千五百零五塊。","pinyin":"Zhèxiē dōngxi yígòng liǎng wàn sān qiān wǔ bǎi líng wǔ kuài.","english":"These stuff cost twenty three thousand, five hundred and five dollars in total.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-20","sourceFront":"零","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-12\",\"起飛\",\"起飛\",\"起飞\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你看，飛機起飛了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-12","sourceFront":"起飛","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"十點了，飛機快(要)起飛了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-16","sourceFront":"快","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"班機起飛前，服務人員都會為旅客說明應注意的安全規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-43","sourceFront":"班機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"起(rise) + 飛(fly) → rise and fly: 起飛(to take off)."},{"key":"[\"B1L10-3-05\",\"擔心\",\"擔心\",\"担心\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他說他會去看醫生，請我們不要擔心，如果他好了，就會來學校上課。","pinyin":"Tā shuō tā huì qù kàn yīshēng, qǐng wǒmen bú yào dānxīn, rúguǒ tā hǎo le, jiù huì lái xuéxiào shàngkè.","english":"He said he will go see a doctor and he does not want to worry us. If he feels better, he will come to school.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我很擔心他，請他去看醫生，也告訴他要聽醫生的話，不要忘記多喝水、多休息。","pinyin":"Wǒ hěn dānxīn tā, qǐng tā qù kàn yīshēng, yě gàosu tā yào tīng yīshēng de huà, bú yào wàngjì duō hē shuǐ, duō xiūxí.","english":"I’m so worried about him, so I told him to go see a doctor. I also told him to listen to the doctor, to drink plenty of water and get some rest.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"擔心 means to worry: 擔(bear) + 心(heart) → carrying a burden on your heart."},{"key":"[\"B1L14-1-04\",\"新年\",\"新年\",\"新年\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你參加過什麼有趣的新年活動？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-04","sourceFront":"新年","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"明天晚上學校有一個新年晚會，你會去參加嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-09","sourceFront":"晚會","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你知道台灣人怎麼慶祝新年嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-3-02","sourceFront":"慶祝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"元宵節燈會是華人新年的重要活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-09","sourceFront":"燈會","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"新年是一個新的開始，所以每年一開始就要做好計畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-39","sourceFront":"一開始","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"等半夜十二點的鐘聲一響，我們就要放鞭炮慶祝新年了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-23","sourceFront":"放","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"等半夜十二點的鐘聲一響，我們就要放鞭炮慶祝新年了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-24","sourceFront":"鞭炮","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今年新年晚會的會場，在學校的大禮堂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-29","sourceFront":"會場","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"除夕那天我送給父母一萬塊的紅包，祝福他們新年快樂，大吉大利！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-12","sourceFront":"紅包","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人在除夕那天，都會跟親人聚在一起吃年夜飯、給紅包，互相恭喜新年好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-26","sourceFront":"親人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每年農曆一月初一是華人新年的第一天","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-25","sourceFront":"初","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人過新年時，如果到好友家拜訪，都會帶著禮物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-03","sourceFront":"拜訪","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少人利用新年期間到國外旅行，國內過年的氣氛就越來越淡了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-42","sourceFront":"氣氛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"再過幾天就要過年了，在此願大家新年平安，事事如意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-55","sourceFront":"願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每次到了新年，華人就會在門前放鞭炮，好好地熱鬧一番。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-54","sourceFront":"番","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人社會中有很多重要的節日，比方(說)中秋節、農曆新年等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-12","sourceFront":"比方說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統在廣場點燃煙火，跟民眾一起慶祝新年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-28","sourceFront":"點燃","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"新(new) + 年(year) → the new year: 新年(New Year)."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-05\",\"还是\",\"還是\",\"还是\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你喜歡山上的風景還是海邊的風景？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān shānshàng de fēngjǐng háishì hǎibiān de fēngjǐng?","english":"Do you like the scenery on the mountain or on the beach?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-11","sourceFront":"風景","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你要果汁還是牛奶？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào guǒzhī háishì niúnǎi?","english":"Do you want juice or milk?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-07","sourceFront":"牛奶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你要喝什麼？咖啡還是茶？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào hē shénme? Kāfēi háishì chá?","english":"What do you want to drink? Coffee or tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-02","sourceFront":"還是","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我們要怎麼去？坐捷運還是坐公車？","pinyin":"Wǒmen yào zěnme qù? Zuò jiéyùn háishì zuò gōngchē?","english":"How do we get there? By MRT or bus?","sourceCardId":"B1L07-1-01","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請問兩位要紅茶還是綠茶？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn liǎng wèi yào hóngchá háishì lǜchá?","english":"Would you like to have black tea or green tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"好啊！你想喝什麼？咖啡還是茶？","pinyin":"Hǎo a! Nǐ xiǎng hē shénme? Kāfēi háishì chá?","english":"Okay! What would you like to drink? Coffee or tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L02-1-20\",\"打掃\",\"打掃\",\"打扫\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你多久沒打掃房間了？真髒！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-20","sourceFront":"打掃","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"弟弟的房間又髒又亂，已經三個月沒打掃了，所以媽媽生他的氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-17","sourceFront":"生氣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽說要把房間打掃得乾乾淨淨的，這樣才能開開心心地過年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-05","sourceFront":"寒假","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽說要把房間打掃得乾乾淨淨的，這樣才能開開心心地過年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-06","sourceFront":"過年","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"許多大學生參加愛心服務的社團，幫助老人打掃環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-09","sourceFront":"許多","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sou