{"chinese":"總統到地震災區慰問災民，並保證會協助他們恢復正常的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-09","sourceFront":"慰問","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統在廣場點燃煙火，跟民眾一起慶祝新年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-28","sourceFront":"點燃","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 總(gather) and 統(govern): 總統 means president."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-26\",\"價值\",\"價值\",\"价值\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每個人的生命價值都是一樣的，不應該為了自己的利益而犧牲別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-26","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"博物館裡的東西非常寶貴， 它們具有民族和文化的價值， 沒辦法用錢算清楚的","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-26","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"博物館內的藝術品價值都很高，不小心弄壞了可是要賠償不少錢的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-09","sourceFront":"賠償","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個時代都有自己的價值標準，社會習俗及生活規矩也常隨著時代改變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-15","sourceFront":"規矩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"用人類的角度去看大自然， 就看不出大自然的本來價值。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-11","sourceFront":"本來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這項研究計畫只針對少部分區域實驗，參考價值不高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-13","sourceFront":"區域","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這棟房子空間小，位置離市區又遠，所以價值三百萬而已。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-24","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 價(price) and 值(price): 價值 means value."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-2-13\",\"使得\",\"使得\",\"使得\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"經過服務人員詳細地說明，使得客人對公司的產品更了解了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-13","sourceFront":"使得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"許多國家因為工業進步得太快，反而使得農業慢慢不被重視了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-22","sourceFront":"工業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個城市夜晚因各種各樣的彩色燈光，而使得景色既浪漫又迷人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-18","sourceFront":"景色","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 使(cause) and 得(get): 使得 means make, to cause."},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-36\",\"傳真\",\"傳真\",\"传真\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這份文件很急，請你下班以前傳真給對方公司。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-36","sourceFront":"傳真","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"有張紙卡在傳真機裡，你拿得出來嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-38","sourceFront":"卡","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-06\",\"烦恼\",\"煩惱\",\"烦恼\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每個人都有煩惱，如果能好好處理，就能從過程中得到經驗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-06","sourceFront":"煩惱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"時間有時能消除煩惱，不能解決的事就暫時放在一邊吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-47","sourceFront":"消除","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"購物是一種享受，超過個人需求的消費，卻只會帶來煩惱。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-43","sourceFront":"享受","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在學習新知識的過程中，總是會有開心與煩惱的時候。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-08","sourceFront":"過程","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他很煩惱，不知道畢業以後要找什麼工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-20","sourceFront":"煩惱","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-2-13\",\"适当\",\"適當\",\"适当\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我與高中同學已十多年沒見了，想找個適當時間邀請大家聚聚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-13","sourceFront":"適當","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這件事我根本不了解，所以沒辦法給你適當的建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-20","sourceFront":"根本","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"工作有壓力時，應適當地分配你的工作及娛樂時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-25","sourceFront":"分配","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-47\",\"还不如\",\"還不如\",\"还不如\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你在外面花錢吃不健康的食物，還不如自己在家煮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-47","sourceFront":"還不如","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-20\",\"算是\",\"算是\",\"算是\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"能得到觀眾熱情掌聲的表演，才算是有魅力的表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-20","sourceFront":"算是","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"現代人生活忙碌，就算是好友也偶然才碰面聊聊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-24","sourceFront":"偶然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-2-23\",\"民間\",\"民間\",\"民间\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"根據華人民間的說法，過年時如果收到紅包，整年就會有好運氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-23","sourceFront":"民間","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"按照我國官方規定，民間辦理環保活動可向官方申請經費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-03","sourceFront":"官方","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-37\",\"建筑\",\"建築\",\"建筑\",\"N/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"處理老房屋的問題，有時比重新建築一棟房子還要困難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-37","sourceFront":"建築","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-50\",\"球隊\",\"球隊\",\"球队\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的球隊因為練習不夠，這一季的表現也不太理想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-50","sourceFr